I'm excited about agents reliably handling genuinely multi-step enterprise workflows end-to-end, the way we did with campaign onboarding. What worries me is organizations deploying agentic systems with real-world write access before their governance and observability maturity catches up — that gap is where I focus a lot of my architecture decisions.

